title: The host stops sharing: the guest's folder closes with a notice, and the host goes on editing and saving
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^after-stop\.line 01\nline 02\nline 03typed-by-beto\.\nline 04\n
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share join nothing Ana
share start writers
wait 10000
share stop
wait 1500
edit notes.txt 1 1
type after-stop.
wait 400
key save
wait 1500
share stop
wait 300
share follow Beto
wait 300
share writer Beto
wait 300
share panel
wait 1200
mark host-after-stop
wait 4000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
edit notes.txt 3 1
key end
type typed-by-beto.
wait 6000
mark after-the-host-stopped
wait 800
share stop
wait 300
share follow Ana
wait 300
share unfollow
wait 300
share panel
wait 1200
mark panel-after
wait 2000
quit
wait 1500
